{"updated":"2026-11-08T15:26:48.403Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Palestinian journalist Abed Abou Shhadeh released after 5 days in detention. Elsewhere, US voters reject AI data centres: could the backlash spread to France?. And what we know so far after Krakow gun attack. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 5.7 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 0.5 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 10.9 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 45 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.8 near central Mid-Atlantic Ridge. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.23,0.27,0.31,0.36,0.4,0.43,0.48,0.51,0.53,0.57,0.59,0.64,0.77,0.86,1.01,1.33,1.45,1.5,1.52,1.56,1.6,1.63,1.65,1.67,1.72,1.76,1.82,1.89,1.94,1.97,2.02,2.07,2.1,2.14,2.18,2.23,2.26,2.3,2.35,2.39,2.44,2.48,2.53,2.59,2.65,2.72,2.83,2.93,3.1,3.12,3.17,3.19,3.25,3.3,3.35,3.47,3.55,3.61,3.68,3.73,3.77,3.82,3.87,3.91,3.94,3.96,4,4.03,4.05,4.08,4.12,4.17,4.25,4.31,4.38,4.42,4.47,4.52,4.55,4.61,4.63,4.69,4.81,4.93,5.11,5.62,5.69,5.76,5.82,5.89,5.93,6,6.07,6.14,6.22,6.27,6.3,6.38,6.43,6.49,6.53,6.56,6.61,6.65,6.7,6.77,6.83,6.91,7.06,7.19,7.26,7.37,7.41,7.5,7.62,7.69,7.74,7.77,7.86,7.91,7.94,7.99,8.08,8.16,8.28,8.39,8.57,8.64,8.7,8.74,8.79,8.84,8.87,8.92,8.94,9,9.06,9.13,9.18,9.22,9.24,9.33,9.61,9.68,9.73,9.82,9.89,9.94,9.98,10.02,10.05,10.1,10.13,10.19,10.28,10.36,10.4,10.48,10.53,10.58,10.67,10.82,11.26,11.38,11.44,11.49,11.54,11.59,11.64,11.68,11.74,11.89,11.94,12.05,12.22,12.38,12.45,12.49,12.59,12.65,12.7,12.72,12.77,12.84,12.89,12.96,13.03,13.11,13.18,13.23,13.32,13.6,13.64,13.72,13.77,13.88,13.97,14.03,14.07,14.11,14.19,14.23,14.33,14.38,14.42,14.54,1